comment = "Bluetooth host, Mesh, emulator, and peer test suite"

desc = <<EOD
ATF/Kyua unit and integration tests for the blued Bluetooth Low Energy
daemon and the libble client library: SMP pairing and cryptography (Core
Spec Vol 3 Part H sample vectors for c1/s1/f4/f5/f6/g2/h6/h7), ATT and GATT
protocol handling, HCI command encoding, connection management, Bluetooth
Mesh models, and advertising-data parsing.  The suite includes a userspace
HCI controller emulator, an independent ATT/SMP peer, end-to-end scenarios,
and standalone libFuzzer harnesses under fuzz/.  Its spec-derived tests are
local regression oracles; they do not replace Bluetooth SIG qualification or
Profile Tuning Suite execution.  Installed in
/usr/tests/usr.sbin/bluetooth/blued and packaged separately from the full base
test suite so it can be installed on its own.
EOD
